        <div begin="1:18.350" end="1:43.890" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="1:18.350" end="1:24.770" itunes:key="L71" ttm:agent="v1">深く朱き潤む瞳 甘い色のスカート揺らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My dewy eyes are deep crimson, I ruffle my sweetly colored skirt</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深红的温润眼眸 艳色的裙尾摇摆</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ku a ka ki u ru mu hi to mi a ma i i ro no su ka a to yu ra su</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:24.780" end="1:31.150" itunes:key="L72" ttm:agent="v1">幼き頰 朱を滲ませ 疼きに足を崩される<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My childish cheeks are flushed crimson, my legs collapse in tingly pain</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幼小的脸颊浸染朱红 疼痛撕裂了双腿</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o sa na ki ho o shu o ni ji ma se u zu ki ni a shi o ku zu sa re ru</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:31.160" end="1:37.560" itunes:key="L73" ttm:agent="v1">甘い幻視に支配され 奏でては咲く五指の調べ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You’re controlled by these sweet hallucinations, I play a tune that blooms from my five fingers</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被甜美的幻视支配 伸展五指弹奏的旋律</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma i gen shi ni shi ha i sa re ka na de te wa sa ku go shi no shi ra be</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:37.570" end="1:43.890" itunes:key="L74" ttm:agent="v1">赤い紅茶 滴る音弄んでは 深く抉る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In the sound of the red black tea dripping, I gouge you deep when I toy with you</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赤色红茶滴下的声音 是我向深处剜心</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ka i ko u cha shi ta ta ru o to mo te a so n de wa fu ka ku e gu ru</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="1:43.660" end="2:09.410" itunes:songPart="PreChorus">
            <p begin="1:43.660" end="1:47.970" itunes:key="L75" ttm:agent="v2">「この想い届かないのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Will my thoughts not reach you?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“这份思念无法传达吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no o mo i to do ka na i no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:49.940" end="1:54.320" itunes:key="L76" ttm:agent="v2">「その瞳には誰が映るのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Who is reflected in your eyes?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“那双眼眸映出的是谁？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no hi to mi ni wa da re ga u tsu ru no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:56.470" end="2:00.350" itunes:key="L77" ttm:agent="v2">「心壊れているのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Is my heart broken?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“心已毁坏了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ko wa re te i ru no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:59.680" end="2:03.600" itunes:key="L78" ttm:agent="v2">「壊れたなら戻らないのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;It won’t come back if it breaks?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“毁坏后无法恢复了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa re ta na ra mo do ra na i no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:02.840" end="2:06.820" itunes:key="L79" ttm:agent="v2">「刻む傷は癒えないのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Will deeply cut wounds never heal?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“受的伤害无法痊愈了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki za mu ki zu wa i e na i no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:06.110" end="2:09.410" itunes:key="L80" ttm:agent="v2">「そうして時を刻むの？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Will you tick away the time in that way?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“这样做能刻画下时间吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u shi te to ki o ki za mu no</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="2:09.140" end="2:34.940" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="2:09.140" end="2:15.600" itunes:key="L81" ttm:agent="v1">あなたのその全てが欲しくて 欲しくて震えてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">All of you, I want it, I want it so much I’m shaking</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要你的全部 想到浑身颤抖</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no so no su be te ga ho shi ku te ho shi ku te fu ru e te ru</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:15.710" end="2:22.050" itunes:key="L82" ttm:agent="v1">甘美なその鼓動を 穿ち尽くして止めようか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Shall I completely pierce through your sweet pulse and stop it?</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让那甜美的心跳 竭尽气力就此停止吧</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kam bi na so no ko do u o u ga chi tsu ku shi te to me yo u ka</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:22.060" end="2:28.420" itunes:key="L83" ttm:agent="v1">その肌を穢し尽し 辱めるのは私だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It’s only me who will completely soil your skin and humiliate you</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情弄脏那片肌肤 污辱你的只有我</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ha da o ke ga shi tsu ku shi ha zu ka shi me ru no wa wa ta shi da ke</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:28.530" end="2:34.940" itunes:key="L84" ttm:agent="v1">愛で撫でて揺さ振らせて この衝動を殺してよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I’m shaken when you adore me and pat me, so kill my urges</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点平息这份爱抚 和操弄你的冲动吧</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me de na de te yu sa fu ra se te ko no sho u do u o ko ro shi te yo</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="2:35.130" end="3:00.700" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="2:35.130" end="2:41.550" itunes:key="L85" ttm:agent="v1">喉を枯らし叫ウ音色 旋律は朱の虹となり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You make your throat hoarse screaming a timbre, the melody turns into a crimson rainbow</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声嘶力竭歌唱的音色 旋律化作朱之虹</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no do o ka ra shi u ta u n e i ro sen ri tsu wa shu no ni ji to na ri</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:41.550" end="2:47.890" itunes:key="L86" ttm:agent="v1">君屠る此ノ色彩 甘く深き色を放つ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">This hue from slaughtering you, what a sweet, deep color it releases!</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一抹屠杀你的色彩 又甜又深的颜色</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ho fu ru ko no shi ki sa i a ma ku fu ka ki i ro o ha na tsu</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:47.930" end="2:54.310" itunes:key="L87" ttm:agent="v1">喉を枯らし叫ウ音色 赤キ雨に彩られたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You make your throat hoarse screaming a timbre, if it’s colored by the red rain</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声嘶力竭歌唱的音色 赤色的雨四处飞溅</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no do o ka ra shi u ta u ne i ro a ka ki a me ni i ro do ra re ta ra</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="2:54.310" end="3:00.700" itunes:key="L88" ttm:agent="v1">綺麗な舞台の出来上がり 私独り其処で踊る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It’ll be the completion of the beautiful stage, and I’ll dance alone there</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">筑成华丽的舞台 我在上面独自起舞</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki re i na bu ta i no de ki a ga ri wa ta shi hi to ri so ko de o do ru</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="3:00.410" end="3:25.780" itunes:songPart="PreChorus">
            <p begin="3:00.410" end="3:04.760" itunes:key="L89" ttm:agent="v2">「その願い潰えたのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Did your wishes get ruined?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“希望破灭了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ne ga i tsu i e ta no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:06.710" end="3:11.200" itunes:key="L90" ttm:agent="v2">「その想い断たれたのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Have those thoughts been suppressed?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“思念断绝了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no o mo i ta ta re ta no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:13.190" end="3:17.280" itunes:key="L91" ttm:agent="v2">「その希望絶えたのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Has that hope been severed?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“希望磨灭了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ki bo u ta e ta no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:16.440" end="3:20.480" itunes:key="L92" ttm:agent="v2">「その瞳焼かれたのかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Have those pupils been set aflame?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“目光燃烧了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no hi to mi ya ka re ta no ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:19.600" end="3:23.580" itunes:key="L93" ttm:agent="v2">「その肌は穢されたかな？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;Has that skin been defiled?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“肌肤污秽了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ha da wa ke ga sa re ta ka na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:22.720" end="3:25.780" itunes:key="L94" ttm:agent="v2">「そして誰もいなくなる？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;And then there were none?&quot;</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“大家都离开我了吗？”</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so shi te da re mo i na ku na ru</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="3:25.810" end="3:52.330" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="3:25.810" end="3:32.410" itunes:key="L95" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ生を引き裂かれて 赤銀を吐き消し飛べ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your life is torn apart, you spit up something red and silver and they spray away</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算把这具身体撕裂 只有赤银烟雾扩散</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no se i o hi ki sa ka re te se ki gin o ha ki ke shi to be</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:32.510" end="3:38.890" itunes:key="L96" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ生の華散らして 極彩に咲き我が糧に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I scatter the flower of your life, blooming in rich colors, and turn you into my food</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让那具身体四分五裂 绽放鲜艳的色彩即我的粮食</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no se i no ha na chi ra shi te go ku sa i ni sa ki wa ga ka te ni</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:38.880" end="3:45.110" itunes:key="L97" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ生がお前ならば 喰らい尽くして血肉にす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If your life is you, then I’ll eat you up into flesh and blood</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果那具身体就是你 我会将肉都吃得干干净净</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no se i ga o ma e na ra ba ku ra i tsu ku shi te chi ni ku ni su</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:45.320" end="3:52.330" itunes:key="L98" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ四肢を贄と捧げ 我が足元の死屍となれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I’ll offer up your limbs as sacrifice- Become the corpse at my feet</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把四肢作为供物 让你成为我脚边的死尸</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no shi shi o ni e to sa sa ge wa ga a shi mo to no shi shi to na re</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="3:51.950" end="4:04.650" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="3:51.950" end="3:55.440" itunes:key="L99" ttm:agent="v1">私の中の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Inside of me</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身体中的</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no na ka no</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:52.810" end="3:53.630" itunes:key="L100" ttm:agent="v2">私の中の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Inside of me</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身体中的</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no na ka no</span>
            </p>
