                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no na ka no</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:54.400" end="3:54.890" itunes:key="L102" ttm:agent="v2">私が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Myself</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ga</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:55.220" end="3:55.720" itunes:key="L103" ttm:agent="v1">ひとつの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There’s one to describe it</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要把这一个</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu no</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="3:55.540" end="3:56.160" itunes:key="L104" ttm:agent="v2">ひとつの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There’s one to describe it</span>
