        <div begin="4:04.740" end="4:17.400" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="4:04.740" end="4:08.010" itunes:key="L120" ttm:agent="v1">掴む左手が甘くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The left arm I’ve caught with was sweet</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握的左手腥甜</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ka mu hi da ri te ga a ma ku te</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:07.180" end="4:08.480" itunes:key="L121" ttm:agent="v2">振るう右手が甘くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The right arm I’ve swung with was sweet</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挥舞的右手腥甜</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru u mi gi te ga a ma ku te</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:08.760" end="4:09.380" itunes:key="L122" ttm:agent="v1">甘くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It was sweet</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">腥甜</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma ku te</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:09.150" end="4:09.700" itunes:key="L123" ttm:agent="v2">甘くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It was sweet</span>
