                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma ku te</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:09.660" end="4:10.880" itunes:key="L124" ttm:agent="v1">笑う口が裂けても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if my mouth with a smile gets torn</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑著的嘴巴裂著</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra u ku chi ga sa ke te mo</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:10.450" end="4:14.250" itunes:key="L125" ttm:agent="v2">それがまた楽しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That’s just fun, so fun</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使如此依然很快乐</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ga ma ta ta no shi ku te</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:11.890" end="4:12.630" itunes:key="L126" ttm:agent="v1">楽しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So fun</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好快乐</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta no shi ku te</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:12.130" end="4:13.360" itunes:key="L127" ttm:agent="v2">脳髄を焼くように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Like burning a brain</span>
