        <div begin="4:17.510" end="4:43.300" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="4:17.510" end="4:23.640" itunes:key="L134" ttm:agent="v1">この気持ち気付いて どうして気付いてくれないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Notice my feelings. Why won’t you notice my feelings?</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你察觉我的心情 为什麼没有察觉到呢？</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki mo chi ki zu i te do u shi te ki zu i te ku re na i no</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:23.940" end="4:29.950" itunes:key="L135" ttm:agent="v1">狂気満ちて行くわ どうすれば止まるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I’m overflowing with insanity, how can I stop?</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐地被陷入疯狂 无论怎样也无法抑止</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u ki mi chi te i ku wa do u su re ba to ma ru no</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:30.350" end="4:36.480" itunes:key="L136" ttm:agent="v1">この気持ち壊れて どこへ辿り着くのでしょうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Where will I make my way to when my feelings break down?</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心情都被毁坏 接著该如何是好</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki mo chi ko wa re te do ko e ta do ri tsu ku no de sho u ka</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="4:36.790" end="4:43.300" itunes:key="L137" ttm:agent="v1">愛溢れて行くわ 止めることはできない…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My love is overflowing, I can’t stop it...</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱就要满溢出来 无法停止……</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i a fu re te i ku wa to me ru ko to wa de ki na i</span>
            </p>
        </div>
