            <p begin="5:07.250" end="5:08.200" itunes:key="L173" ttm:agent="v1">殺してあげる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I’ll kill you!</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我杀了你！</span>
