        <div begin="5:08.210" end="5:34.600" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="5:08.210" end="5:14.800" itunes:key="L174" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ生を引き裂かれて 赤銀を吐き消し飛べ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your life is torn apart, you spit up something red and silver and they spray away</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算把这具身体撕裂 只有赤银烟雾扩散</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no se i o hi ki sa ka re te se ki gin o ha ki ke shi to be</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="5:14.910" end="5:21.090" itunes:key="L175" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ生の華散らして 極彩に咲き我が糧に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I scatter the flower of your life, blooming in rich colors, and turn you into my food</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让那具身体四分五裂 绽放鲜艳的色彩即我的粮食</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no se i no ha na chi ra shi te go ku se i ni sa ki wa ga ka te ni</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="5:21.290" end="5:27.600" itunes:key="L176" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ生がお前ならば 喰らい尽くして血肉にす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If your life is you, then I’ll eat you up into flesh and blood</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果那具身体就是你 我会将肉都吃得干干净净</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no se i ga o ma e na ra ba ku ra i tsu ku shi te chi ni ku ni su</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="5:27.700" end="5:34.600" itunes:key="L177" ttm:agent="v1">其ノ四肢を贄と捧げ 我が足元の死屍となれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I’ll offer up your limbs as sacrifice- Become the corpse at my feet</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把四肢作为供物 让你成为我脚边的死尸</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no shi shi o ni e to sa sa ge wa ga a shi mo to no shi shi to na re</span>
            </p>
        </div>
